    "    \"1. **YAML Setup:** Do you have `conf/config.yaml`, `conf/api/openmeteo.yaml`, `conf/paths/default.yaml`, and `conf/tracking/mlflow.yaml` correctly structured?\\n\",\n",
    "    \"2. **Default Execution:** Did `python src/ingestion/get_data.py` run successfully and save a new CSV in `data/raw/`?\\n\",\n",
    "    \"3. **Dynamic Override:** Run the script passing Faro's coordinates (`api.params.latitude=37.0187 api.params.longitude=-7.9272`). Open the resulting CSV file and verify the temperature values are different from your default run.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"4. **Dynamic MLflow:** Run `lab3_hydra_integration.py` and verify in the MLflow UI that the new experiment `Lab3_Hydra_Dynamic_Config` was created.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"5. **Config Logging:** Check the parameters of that run. Can you see the `api_latitude` and `api_longitude` logged alongside your `dvc_data_hash`?\\n\",\n",
    "    \"6. **DVC Sync:** Do not forget to run these commands:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\t- `dvc add data/raw` to track the new data with DVC.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\t- `dvc commit -q` to commit the changes in DVC.\\n\",\n",
